          <div class="success-links" aria-label="Riordan Alumni links" style="margin-top: 34px;">
            <a href="https://www.anderson.ucla.edu/specialized-academic-programs/riordan-programs/alumni-association" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">More about The Riordan Programs Alumni Association</a>
